{"page":"TAF5","gene":"TAF5","accession":"Q15542","protein":"Transcription initiation factor TFIID subunit 5","length":800,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"Q15542-1","name":"Long","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000369839.4"],"refseq":["NM_006951.5"],"refseqProteins":["NP_008882.2"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q15542-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q15542-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":75.5,"plddt":[[0,90],[50,3],[70,27],[50,2],[0,84],[50,3],[70,5],[90,2],[70,1],[90,32],[70,1],[90,2],[70,3],[90,29],[70,19],[90,17],[70,2],[90,1],[70,13],[90,6],[70,3],[90,5],[70,1],[90,5],[70,1],[90,7],[70,2],[90,1],[70,2],[90,8],[70,4],[50,3],[0,31],[50,2],[70,2],[90,4],[70,1],[90,10],[70,1],[90,6],[70,1],[90,6],[70,1],[90,4],[70,1],[90,8],[70,10],[90,26],[70,36],[90,164],[70,3],[90,3],[70,1],[90,16],[70,3],[90,16],[70,5],[50,10],[70,12],[90,8],[70,3],[90,16],[70,5],[50,1]]}},"features":[{"type":"Domain","start":92,"end":124,"description":"LisH"},{"type":"Region","start":194,"end":340,"description":"NTD2; involved in homodimerization; also involved in TFIID-TFIIF contacts in the RNA Pol II pre-initiation complex (PIC)"},{"type":"Repeat","start":468,"end":507,"description":"WD 1"},{"type":"Repeat","start":541,"end":580,"description":"WD 2"},{"type":"Repeat","start":583,"end":624,"description":"WD 3"},{"type":"Repeat","start":625,"end":666,"description":"WD 4"},{"type":"Repeat","start":667,"end":706,"description":"WD 5"},{"type":"Repeat","start":709,"end":748,"description":"WD 6"}],"interfaces":{"TAF6":[264,268,273,276,279,280,281,283,284,285,287,289,290,292,293,294,295,458,459,460,461,462,463,464,465,466,467,468,469,470,473,474,485,489,490,495,497,536,538,544,545,547,563,586,587,589,605,629,631,673,689,712,713,715,731,732,735,773,774,775,776,781,790]},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Homodimer (PubMed:17227857). Component of the TFIID basal transcription factor complex, composed of TATA-box-binding protein TBP, and a number of TBP-associated factors (TAFs), including TAF1, TAF2, TAF3, TAF4, TAF5, TAF6, TAF7, TAF8, TAF9, TAF10, TAF11, TAF12 and TAF13 (PubMed:10373431, PubMed:33795473). The TFIID complex structure can be divided into 3 modules TFIID-A, TFIID-B, and TFIID-C (PubMed:33795473). TAF5 forms the TFIID-A module together with TAF3 and TBP, and in TFIID-B with TAF8 (PubMed:33795473). Component of the TFTC-HAT complex, at least composed of TAF5L, TAF6L, TADA3L, SUPT3H/SPT3, TAF2, TAF4, TAF5, GCN5L2/GCN5, TAF10 and TRRAP (PubMed:10373431, PubMed:12601814, PubMed:17227857). TBP is not part of the TFTC-HAT complex (PubMed:10373431, PubMed:12601814). Interacts strongly with the histone H4-related TAF6 and the histone H3-related TAF9, as well as a stable complex comprised of both TAF6 and TAF9 (PubMed:9045704). Apparently weaker interactions with TBP, TAF1, TAF11, and TAF12, but not TAF7, also have been observed (PubMed:8758937, PubMed:9045704)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with SV40 Large T antigen"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"Q15542-2","name":"Short","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":745,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000692195.1"],"refseq":["NM_139052.3"],"refseqProteins":["NP_620640.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,555],[556,611,190]],"edits":[{"start":556,"end":610,"original":"NYLLSSSEDGTVRLWSLQTFTCLVGYKGHNYPVWDTQFSP","replacement":"","added":0}],"missing":55,"replaced":0,"novel":0,"foldedAbsent":55,"foldedMissing":55,"features":[[3,25,0],[4,28,0]],"interfaces":{"TAF6":[5,0,63]},"model":{"entry":"AF-Q15542-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-Q15542-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":70.2,"plddt":[[0,90],[50,1],[0,1],[50,1],[70,25],[50,4],[0,84],[50,3],[70,8],[90,31],[70,9],[90,25],[70,21],[90,17],[70,16],[90,6],[70,3],[90,11],[70,1],[90,7],[70,7],[90,3],[70,6],[50,5],[0,30],[50,2],[70,39],[90,5],[70,4],[50,7],[70,8],[50,1],[70,19],[50,2],[70,1],[50,1]